              ],
              "segment": {
                "start_index": 2718,
                "end_index": 2895,
                "part_index": null,
                "text": "Hedge Funds\nIf you have heard that fund managers make **\"2 and 20\"** (2% of assets and 20% of all profits), you are thinking of **hedge fund managers**, not mutual fund managers"
